      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصِيصَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A camel,</i> (M, K,) or <i>horse,</i> or <i>the like,</i>
(M,) <i>with which one follows,</i> or <i>follows after,</i> (M,
K,) <i>footsteps,</i> (M,) or <i>the footsteps of travellingcamels:</i> (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَائِصُ</span>. (Ibn-'Abbád, TA.) ＝ 
 
